# Documentation protocol

Work is incomplete without docs.

## Every proposed commit

Create `docs/commits/<YYYY-MM-DD>-<slug>.md` from `docs/templates/commit.md`.
Explain **why**, not only what changed. Include architecture impact: `none` or `pending approval`.

## New work

| Kind | Location |
| --- | --- |
| Feature / story | `docs/features/<name>.md` from `docs/templates/feature.md` |
| Layer or package | `docs/architecture/` |
| Domain / persistence model | `docs/architecture/models.md` (create if missing) |
| Infra / technology | `docs/architecture/` or `docs/infra/` |

Keep `docs/README.md` as the index. Do not dump architecture essays into code comments.
